; The rules, one by one. In from filter: a section of rules, or a card to pass on. A rule is 600, its length, its
; left elements and 0, its right elements and 0, then its phonemes up to the next 600 or 999. The left elements go
; to the left context machine (OUT at ol), the right to the right one (OUT at or); their answers come back (INP at
; vd, gr). Both 1: the length to loader (OUT at al), -1 to both context machines (OUT at dl, dr), the phonemes out,
; and the rest of the section skipped. Else 0 to loader (OUT at no), and on to the next rule.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            top     INP   x        03-06: a rule, or a card to pass on
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    SUB   c600
  06                    TAC   pass
  07            rul     INP   len      07-25: the elements to the context machines, and their answers
  08            fl      INP   y
  09            ol      OUT   y
  10                    CLA   y
  11                    SUB   00
  12                    TAC   fr
  13                    JMP   fl
  14            fr      INP   y
  15            or      OUT   y
  16                    CLA   y
  17                    SUB   00
  18                    TAC   vd
  19                    JMP   fr
  20            vd      INP   v
  21            gr      INP   w
  22                    CLA   v
  23                    ADD   w
  24                    SUB   n2
  25                    TAC   no
  26            al      OUT   len      26-40: it matched: the phonemes out, the rest skipped
  27            dl      OUT   m1
  28            dr      OUT   m1
  29            ph      INP   x
  30                    CLA   x
  31                    SUB   c600
  32                    TAC   phout
  33            sk      CLA   x
  34                    SUB   c999
  35                    TAC   sk2
  36                    JMP   top
  37            sk2     INP   x
  38                    JMP   sk
  39            phout   OUT   x
  40                    JMP   ph
  41            no      OUT   z        41-51: it did not: on to the next rule
  42            nsk     INP   x
  43                    CLA   x
  44                    SUB   c600
  45                    TAC   nsk
  46                    CLA   x
  47                    SUB   c999
  48                    TAC   rul
  49                    JMP   top
  50            pass    OUT   x
  51                    JMP   top
  60            x       DATA  0
  61            len     DATA  0
  62            y       DATA  0
  63            v       DATA  0
  64            w       DATA  0
  65            z       DATA  0
  66            n2      DATA  2
  67            m1      DATA  -1
  68            c600    DATA  600
  69            c999    DATA  999
